	Tavaré S (1985) Some probabilistic and statistical problems in the analysis of DNA sequences. In: Miura R. M., editor. Lectures on Mathematics in the Life Sciences. 17, 57-86
Discrete gamma-distributed rate heterogeneity model:
	Yang Z (1994) Maximum likelihood phylogenetic estimation from DNA sequences with variable rates over sites: approximate methods. J. Mol. Evol.. 39, 306-314

TRAIT MODELS
